{"seq":2,"slug":"atomic-core-ideas","title":"原子操作的核心思想","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/threads-concurrency/atomic-operations/atomic-core-ideas","wordCount":1479,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"原子操作的核心思想\">原子操作的核心思想</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>原子操作的核心思想是：<strong>在不使用锁的前提下，通过硬件级别的支持保证操作的不可分割性</strong>。它用最小的代价解决最常见的并发问题，是&quot;轻量级同步&quot;的代表。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>锁（Locking）</th>\n<th>原子操作（Atomic）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>性能</strong></td>\n<td>开销大（挂起、上下文切换）</td>\n<td>极佳（单条硬件指令）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>死锁风险</strong></td>\n<td>有（多锁场景需预防）</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>适用范围</strong></td>\n<td>通用，可保护多变量多步操作</td>\n<td>仅适合单个变量或简单操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>阻塞行为</strong></td>\n<td>竞争时线程被挂起</td>\n<td>竞争时忙等重试，不主动让出 CPU</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  C[&quot;原子操作的核心思想&quot;] --&gt; I1[&quot;思想一:不可分割性&lt;br/&gt;外部只见操作前或操作后&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; I2[&quot;思想二:无锁线程安全&lt;br/&gt;用硬件指令替代锁&quot;]&#10;  I1 --&gt; R1[&quot;消除中间状态,杜绝丢失更新&quot;]&#10;  I2 --&gt; R2[&quot;避免挂起与上下文切换开销&quot;]&#10;  I2 --&gt; R3[&quot;限制:只适合简单操作&quot;]\">graph TD\n  C[\"原子操作的核心思想\"] --&gt; I1[\"思想一:不可分割性&lt;br/&gt;外部只见操作前或操作后\"]\n  C --&gt; I2[\"思想二:无锁线程安全&lt;br/&gt;用硬件指令替代锁\"]\n  I1 --&gt; R1[\"消除中间状态,杜绝丢失更新\"]\n  I2 --&gt; R2[\"避免挂起与上下文切换开销\"]\n  I2 --&gt; R3[\"限制:只适合简单操作\"]</pre><p>这里存在一个明确的<strong>权衡</strong>：原子操作以免除阻塞为代价，换取了高得多的性能，但也把适用范围收窄到单变量或简单复合操作。当逻辑涉及多个变量、需要跨步骤保持一致性时，必须回到锁——这正是&quot;用大炮打蚊子&quot;的反面：<strong>原子操作是轻武器，用错场景便会失效</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"问题背景\">问题背景</h2><p>在并发编程中，保护共享数据的传统方式是使用<strong>锁（Lock）</strong>。锁虽然有效，但带来了显著的性能开销：线程在等待锁的过程中被挂起，涉及上下文切换、内核调度等昂贵的操作。对于简单的数据操作（如计数器加一、标志位翻转），使用锁就像用大炮打蚊子——<strong>过度重量级</strong>。</p>\n<p>原子操作的核心思想就是：<strong>在不使用锁的前提下，通过硬件级别的支持来保证操作的不可分割性</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    PROBLEM[&quot;Shared data&lt;br/&gt;concurrent access&quot;]&#10;&#10;    PROBLEM --&gt; LOCK[&quot;Approach A: Locking&quot;]&#10;    PROBLEM --&gt; ATOMIC[&quot;Approach B: Atomic operations&quot;]&#10;&#10;    LOCK --&gt; L1[&quot;✅ Highly versatile&quot;]&#10;    LOCK --&gt; L2[&quot;❌ High performance overhead&quot;]&#10;    LOCK --&gt; L3[&quot;❌ Possible deadlock&quot;]&#10;&#10;    ATOMIC --&gt; A1[&quot;✅ Excellent performance&quot;]&#10;    ATOMIC --&gt; A2[&quot;✅ No deadlock risk&quot;]&#10;    ATOMIC --&gt; A3[&quot;❌ Only suitable for simple operations&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    PROBLEM[\"Shared data&lt;br/&gt;concurrent access\"]\n\n    PROBLEM --&gt; LOCK[\"Approach A: Locking\"]\n    PROBLEM --&gt; ATOMIC[\"Approach B: Atomic operations\"]\n\n    LOCK --&gt; L1[\"✅ Highly versatile\"]\n    LOCK --&gt; L2[\"❌ High performance overhead\"]\n    LOCK --&gt; L3[\"❌ Possible deadlock\"]\n\n    ATOMIC --&gt; A1[\"✅ Excellent performance\"]\n    ATOMIC --&gt; A2[\"✅ No deadlock risk\"]\n    ATOMIC --&gt; A3[\"❌ Only suitable for simple operations\"]</pre><blockquote>\n<p>原子操作是&quot;轻量级同步&quot;的代表：用最小的代价解决最常见的并发问题。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心原理\">核心原理</h2><h3 id=\"思想一-不可分割性\">思想一：不可分割性</h3><p>原子操作最根本的思想是<strong>不可分割性（Indivisibility）</strong>——在操作执行过程中，没有任何其他线程能够介入或观察到中间状态。</p>\n<p>这意味着从任何外部观察者的角度来看，原子操作要么<strong>还没开始</strong>，要么<strong>已经完成</strong>，永远不会处于&quot;执行了一半&quot;的状态。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"// 非原子操作：三个步骤，其他线程可在任意间隙介入&#10;temp = 读取(counter)        // ← 其他线程可在此处介入&#10;temp = temp + 1              // ← 或此处&#10;写回(counter, temp)          // ← 或此处&#10;&#10;// 原子操作：整体不可分割，外部只能看到操作前或操作后的状态&#10;原子执行 {&#10;  temp = 读取(counter)&#10;  temp = temp + 1&#10;  写回(counter, temp)&#10;}  // 整个过程对外部是&quot;瞬间&quot;完成的\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 非原子操作：三个步骤，其他线程可在任意间隙介入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>temp = 读取(counter)        // ← 其他线程可在此处介入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>temp = temp + 1              // ← 或此处</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>写回(counter, temp)          // ← 或此处</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 原子操作：整体不可分割，外部只能看到操作前或操作后的状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>原子执行 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  temp = 读取(counter)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  temp = temp + 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  写回(counter, temp)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}  // 整个过程对外部是\"瞬间\"完成的</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant OBS as External Observer&#10;    participant OP as Atomic Operation&#10;&#10;    Note over OP: State: Not started&#10;    OBS-&gt;&gt;OP: Observe → See &quot;Not started&quot;&#10;&#10;    rect rgb(220, 252, 231)&#10;        Note over OP: Executing (unobservable transitional state)&#10;        OP-&gt;&gt;OP: Read → Modify → Write back&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    Note over OP: State: Completed&#10;    OBS-&gt;&gt;OP: Observe → See &quot;Completed&quot;&#10;&#10;    Note over OBS,OP: External observer can never see&lt;br/&gt;a &quot;half-executed&quot; state\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant OBS as External Observer\n    participant OP as Atomic Operation\n\n    Note over OP: State: Not started\n    OBS-&gt;&gt;OP: Observe → See \"Not started\"\n\n    rect rgb(220, 252, 231)\n        Note over OP: Executing (unobservable transitional state)\n        OP-&gt;&gt;OP: Read → Modify → Write back\n    end\n\n    Note over OP: State: Completed\n    OBS-&gt;&gt;OP: Observe → See \"Completed\"\n\n    Note over OBS,OP: External observer can never see&lt;br/&gt;a \"half-executed\" state</pre><h3 id=\"思想二-无锁线程安全\">思想二：无锁线程安全</h3><p>原子操作的第二个核心思想是<strong>不需要显式的同步原语（如锁）就能实现线程安全</strong>。</p>\n<p>使用锁时，线程需要经历&quot;获取锁 → 执行操作 → 释放锁&quot;的流程，如果锁被其他线程持有，当前线程就会<strong>阻塞等待</strong>。而原子操作跳过了这个中间环节，直接在硬件层面保证操作的安全性。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph &quot;Lock-Based Approach&quot;&#10;        direction TB&#10;        LK1[&quot;Thread requests operation&quot;]&#10;        LK2{&quot;Is lock available?&quot;}&#10;        LK3[&quot;Acquire lock&quot;]&#10;        LK4[&quot;Execute operation&quot;]&#10;        LK5[&quot;Release lock&quot;]&#10;        LK6[&quot;Block and wait&lt;br/&gt;(context switch)&quot;]&#10;&#10;        LK1 --&gt; LK2&#10;        LK2 --&gt;|&quot;Yes&quot;| LK3 --&gt; LK4 --&gt; LK5&#10;        LK2 --&gt;|&quot;No&quot;| LK6&#10;        LK6 -.-&gt;|&quot;Wake up when lock available&quot;| LK3&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph &quot;Atomic Operation Approach&quot;&#10;        direction TB&#10;        AT1[&quot;Thread requests operation&quot;]&#10;        AT2[&quot;CPU executes atomic instruction&quot;]&#10;        AT3[&quot;Operation complete&quot;]&#10;&#10;        AT1 --&gt; AT2 --&gt; AT3&#10;    end\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph \"Lock-Based Approach\"\n        direction TB\n        LK1[\"Thread requests operation\"]\n        LK2{\"Is lock available?\"}\n        LK3[\"Acquire lock\"]\n        LK4[\"Execute operation\"]\n        LK5[\"Release lock\"]\n        LK6[\"Block and wait&lt;br/&gt;(context switch)\"]\n\n        LK1 --&gt; LK2\n        LK2 --&gt;|\"Yes\"| LK3 --&gt; LK4 --&gt; LK5\n        LK2 --&gt;|\"No\"| LK6\n        LK6 -.-&gt;|\"Wake up when lock available\"| LK3\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"Atomic Operation Approach\"\n        direction TB\n        AT1[\"Thread requests operation\"]\n        AT2[\"CPU executes atomic instruction\"]\n        AT3[\"Operation complete\"]\n\n        AT1 --&gt; AT2 --&gt; AT3\n    end</pre><p>对比两种方式的线程安全实现：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// ---- 基于锁的线程安全 ----&#10;class LockedCounter {&#10;  private value = 0;&#10;  private lock = new Mutex();&#10;&#10;  increment(): void {&#10;    this.lock.acquire(); // 可能阻塞&#10;    this.value += 1;&#10;    this.lock.release();&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// ---- 基于原子操作的线程安全 ----&#10;class AtomicCounter {&#10;  private value = new AtomicInteger(0);&#10;&#10;  increment(): void {&#10;    this.value.fetchAdd(1); // 永不阻塞，硬件保证安全&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ---- 基于锁的线程安全 ----</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LockedCounter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> lock</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Mutex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  increment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.lock.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">acquire</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 可能阻塞</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.lock.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">release</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ---- 基于原子操作的线程安全 ----</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AtomicCounter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AtomicInteger</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  increment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.value.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fetchAdd</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 永不阻塞，硬件保证安全</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"思想三-硬件级高效性\">思想三：硬件级高效性</h3><p>原子操作的第三个核心思想是<strong>充分利用硬件能力来实现高效的并发控制</strong>。</p>\n<p>现代 CPU 提供了专门的原子指令，这些指令在硬件层面保证了操作的不可分割性。相比于操作系统层面的锁机制，硬件原子指令的开销小得多：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">操作</th>\n<th align=\"left\">开销量级</th>\n<th align=\"left\">涉及的层次</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\">普通读写</td>\n<td align=\"left\">~1 ns</td>\n<td align=\"left\">CPU 寄存器 / 缓存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">原子操作</td>\n<td align=\"left\">~10-50 ns</td>\n<td align=\"left\">CPU 缓存一致性协议</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">锁（无竞争）</td>\n<td align=\"left\">~20-100 ns</td>\n<td align=\"left\">操作系统内核</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">锁（有竞争）</td>\n<td align=\"left\">~1000+ ns</td>\n<td align=\"left\">内核调度 + 上下文切换</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart BT&#10;    HW[&quot;Hardware Layer&lt;br/&gt;CPU atomic instructions&quot;]&#10;    CACHE[&quot;Cache Layer&lt;br/&gt;Cache coherence protocol (MESI)&quot;]&#10;    OS[&quot;OS Layer&lt;br/&gt;Mutex, Semaphore&quot;]&#10;    APP[&quot;Application Layer&lt;br/&gt;Concurrent data structures&quot;]&#10;&#10;    HW --&gt; CACHE --&gt; OS --&gt; APP&#10;&#10;    HW -.- NOTE1[&quot;CAS, XCHG, ADD&lt;br/&gt;Minimal overhead&quot;]&#10;    OS -.- NOTE2[&quot;Mutex, Semaphore&lt;br/&gt;Higher overhead&quot;]\">flowchart BT\n    HW[\"Hardware Layer&lt;br/&gt;CPU atomic instructions\"]\n    CACHE[\"Cache Layer&lt;br/&gt;Cache coherence protocol (MESI)\"]\n    OS[\"OS Layer&lt;br/&gt;Mutex, Semaphore\"]\n    APP[\"Application Layer&lt;br/&gt;Concurrent data structures\"]\n\n    HW --&gt; CACHE --&gt; OS --&gt; APP\n\n    HW -.- NOTE1[\"CAS, XCHG, ADD&lt;br/&gt;Minimal overhead\"]\n    OS -.- NOTE2[\"Mutex, Semaphore&lt;br/&gt;Higher overhead\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"分类与变体\">分类与变体</h2><h3 id=\"cas-比较并交换\">CAS：比较并交换</h3><p><strong>CAS（Compare-And-Swap）</strong> 是最重要的原子操作原语，几乎所有高级原子操作都基于它实现。CAS 的语义是：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>如果变量的当前值等于期望值，则将其更新为新值；否则不做任何修改。整个过程是原子的。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"函数 CAS(地址, 期望值, 新值) -&gt; 布尔值:&#10;    原子执行 {&#10;        如果 *地址 == 期望值:&#10;            *地址 = 新值&#10;            返回 真    // 交换成功&#10;        否则:&#10;            返回 假    // 交换失败，当前值已被其他线程修改&#10;    }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>函数 CAS(地址, 期望值, 新值) -> 布尔值:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    原子执行 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        如果 *地址 == 期望值:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            *地址 = 新值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            返回 真    // 交换成功</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        否则:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            返回 假    // 交换失败，当前值已被其他线程修改</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span></code></pre></div><p>CAS 的典型使用模式是<strong>自旋重试</strong>——如果 CAS 失败（说明有其他线程抢先修改了值），就重新读取当前值并再次尝试：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    START[&quot;Start&quot;]&#10;    READ[&quot;Read current value current&quot;]&#10;    COMPUTE[&quot;Compute new value next = f(current)&quot;]&#10;    CAS{&quot;CAS(current, next)&quot;}&#10;    SUCCESS[&quot;Operation succeeded ✅&quot;]&#10;    RETRY[&quot;Retry (spin)&quot;]&#10;&#10;    START --&gt; READ --&gt; COMPUTE --&gt; CAS&#10;    CAS --&gt;|&quot;Success&quot;| SUCCESS&#10;    CAS --&gt;|&quot;Failure: value already modified&quot;| RETRY&#10;    RETRY --&gt; READ\">flowchart TD\n    START[\"Start\"]\n    READ[\"Read current value current\"]\n    COMPUTE[\"Compute new value next = f(current)\"]\n    CAS{\"CAS(current, next)\"}\n    SUCCESS[\"Operation succeeded ✅\"]\n    RETRY[\"Retry (spin)\"]\n\n    START --&gt; READ --&gt; COMPUTE --&gt; CAS\n    CAS --&gt;|\"Success\"| SUCCESS\n    CAS --&gt;|\"Failure: value already modified\"| RETRY\n    RETRY --&gt; READ</pre><p>用 CAS 实现原子加一：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function atomicIncrement(atom: AtomicInteger): void {&#10;  let success = false;&#10;  while (!success) {&#10;    const current = atom.load();&#10;    const next = current + 1;&#10;    success = atom.compareAndSwap(current, next);&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> atomicIncrement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">atom</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AtomicInteger</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> success </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">success) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> current</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> atom.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">load</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> next</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    success </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> atom.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">compareAndSwap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(current, next);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"cas-的-aba-问题\">CAS 的 ABA 问题</h3><p>CAS 有一个经典的陷阱——<strong>ABA 问题</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"初始状态: value = A&#10;&#10;线程 1: 读取 value → A&#10;线程 2: 将 value 从 A 改为 B&#10;线程 2: 将 value 从 B 改回 A&#10;线程 1: CAS(期望=A, 新值=C) → 成功！&#10;&#10;// 线程 1 的 CAS 成功了，但它并不知道 value 曾经被改变过&#10;// 在某些场景下（如链表操作），这可能导致逻辑错误\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>初始状态: value = A</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>线程 1: 读取 value → A</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>线程 2: 将 value 从 A 改为 B</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>线程 2: 将 value 从 B 改回 A</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>线程 1: CAS(期望=A, 新值=C) → 成功！</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 线程 1 的 CAS 成功了，但它并不知道 value 曾经被改变过</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 在某些场景下（如链表操作），这可能导致逻辑错误</span></span></code></pre></div><p>解决 ABA 问题的常见方法是给值<strong>附加一个版本号</strong>，每次修改时版本号递增：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"原子变量 = { 值: A, 版本: 1 }&#10;&#10;线程 1: 读取 → { A, 1 }&#10;线程 2: 修改 → { B, 2 } → { A, 3 }&#10;线程 1: CAS(期望={A, 1}, 新值={C, 2}) → 失败！版本不匹配\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>原子变量 = { 值: A, 版本: 1 }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>线程 1: 读取 → { A, 1 }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>线程 2: 修改 → { B, 2 } → { A, 3 }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>线程 1: CAS(期望={A, 1}, 新值={C, 2}) → 失败！版本不匹配</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"工作流程\">工作流程</h2><p>以一个完整的无锁计数器为例，展示原子操作在实际并发场景中的工作流程：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant C as Counter (value=10)&#10;    participant A as Thread A&#10;    participant B as Thread B&#10;&#10;    Note over C: value = 10&#10;&#10;    A-&gt;&gt;C: load() → 10&#10;    B-&gt;&gt;C: load() → 10&#10;&#10;    A-&gt;&gt;A: Compute 10 + 1 = 11&#10;    B-&gt;&gt;B: Compute 10 + 1 = 11&#10;&#10;    A-&gt;&gt;C: CAS(10, 11) → Success ✅&#10;    Note over C: value = 11&#10;&#10;    B-&gt;&gt;C: CAS(10, 11) → Failure ❌&#10;    Note over B: Value changed to 11, retry&#10;&#10;    B-&gt;&gt;C: load() → 11&#10;    B-&gt;&gt;B: Compute 11 + 1 = 12&#10;    B-&gt;&gt;C: CAS(11, 12) → Success ✅&#10;    Note over C: value = 12 ✅\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant C as Counter (value=10)\n    participant A as Thread A\n    participant B as Thread B\n\n    Note over C: value = 10\n\n    A-&gt;&gt;C: load() → 10\n    B-&gt;&gt;C: load() → 10\n\n    A-&gt;&gt;A: Compute 10 + 1 = 11\n    B-&gt;&gt;B: Compute 10 + 1 = 11\n\n    A-&gt;&gt;C: CAS(10, 11) → Success ✅\n    Note over C: value = 11\n\n    B-&gt;&gt;C: CAS(10, 11) → Failure ❌\n    Note over B: Value changed to 11, retry\n\n    B-&gt;&gt;C: load() → 11\n    B-&gt;&gt;B: Compute 11 + 1 = 12\n    B-&gt;&gt;C: CAS(11, 12) → Success ✅\n    Note over C: value = 12 ✅</pre><blockquote>\n<p>通过 CAS + 自旋重试，两个线程在无锁的情况下正确完成了计数器的递增操作。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"优劣对比\">优劣对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">维度</th>\n<th align=\"left\">原子操作</th>\n<th align=\"left\">锁（Mutex）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>性能</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">高（硬件指令，纳秒级）</td>\n<td align=\"left\">低（涉及内核，微秒级）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>阻塞行为</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">不阻塞（自旋或立即完成）</td>\n<td align=\"left\">可能阻塞（线程挂起）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>死锁风险</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">无</td>\n<td align=\"left\">有（不当使用时）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>适用范围</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">单变量简单操作</td>\n<td align=\"left\">任意复杂的临界区</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>公平性</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">不保证（可能饥饿）</td>\n<td align=\"left\">可配置公平策略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>编程复杂度</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">较高（需理解内存模型）</td>\n<td align=\"left\">较低（语义直观）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>竞争激烈时</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">性能下降（大量自旋）</td>\n<td align=\"left\">性能相对稳定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p>在低竞争场景下，原子操作的性能优势非常明显。但在高竞争场景下（大量线程频繁争抢同一变量），自旋重试的开销会急剧增加，此时锁反而可能更合适。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    DECIDE[&quot;Choose synchronization strategy&quot;]&#10;    Q1{&quot;Does the operation involve&lt;br/&gt;only a single simple variable?&quot;}&#10;    Q2{&quot;Is thread contention&lt;br/&gt;high?&quot;}&#10;&#10;    DECIDE --&gt; Q1&#10;    Q1 --&gt;|&quot;No&quot;| LOCK[&quot;Use locks&quot;]&#10;    Q1 --&gt;|&quot;Yes&quot;| Q2&#10;    Q2 --&gt;|&quot;Low contention&quot;| ATOMIC[&quot;Use atomic operations ✅&quot;]&#10;    Q2 --&gt;|&quot;High contention&quot;| CONSIDER[&quot;Evaluate: Atomic ops vs Locks&lt;br/&gt;Benchmarking needed&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    DECIDE[\"Choose synchronization strategy\"]\n    Q1{\"Does the operation involve&lt;br/&gt;only a single simple variable?\"}\n    Q2{\"Is thread contention&lt;br/&gt;high?\"}\n\n    DECIDE --&gt; Q1\n    Q1 --&gt;|\"No\"| LOCK[\"Use locks\"]\n    Q1 --&gt;|\"Yes\"| Q2\n    Q2 --&gt;|\"Low contention\"| ATOMIC[\"Use atomic operations ✅\"]\n    Q2 --&gt;|\"High contention\"| CONSIDER[\"Evaluate: Atomic ops vs Locks&lt;br/&gt;Benchmarking needed\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph Three Core Ideas&#10;        I1[&quot;Indivisibility&lt;br/&gt;No intermediate state in operations&quot;]&#10;        I2[&quot;Lock-free thread safety&lt;br/&gt;No explicit synchronization needed&quot;]&#10;        I3[&quot;Hardware-level efficiency&lt;br/&gt;CPU instruction support&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph Key Mechanisms&#10;        CAS[&quot;CAS (Compare-and-Swap)&quot;]&#10;        SPIN[&quot;Spin retry&quot;]&#10;        ABA[&quot;ABA problem and versioning&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    I1 ~~~ I2 ~~~ I3&#10;    CAS ~~~ SPIN ~~~ ABA\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph Three Core Ideas\n        I1[\"Indivisibility&lt;br/&gt;No intermediate state in operations\"]\n        I2[\"Lock-free thread safety&lt;br/&gt;No explicit synchronization needed\"]\n        I3[\"Hardware-level efficiency&lt;br/&gt;CPU instruction support\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph Key Mechanisms\n        CAS[\"CAS (Compare-and-Swap)\"]\n        SPIN[\"Spin retry\"]\n        ABA[\"ABA problem and versioning\"]\n    end\n\n    I1 ~~~ I2 ~~~ I3\n    CAS ~~~ SPIN ~~~ ABA</pre><ul>\n<li>原子操作的核心思想是<strong>不可分割性</strong>——操作对外界表现为瞬间完成，无中间状态</li>\n<li>原子操作实现了<strong>无锁的线程安全</strong>，避免了锁带来的阻塞、上下文切换和死锁风险</li>\n<li>原子操作依赖<strong>硬件级支持</strong>（CPU 原子指令），性能远优于操作系统级的锁机制</li>\n<li><strong>CAS（比较并交换）</strong> 是最核心的原子操作原语，配合自旋重试构成无锁编程的基础</li>\n<li>需要注意 CAS 的 <strong>ABA 问题</strong>，可通过版本号机制解决</li>\n<li>原子操作最适合<strong>低竞争、简单操作</strong>的场景；高竞争或复杂操作场景仍应考虑使用锁</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"原子操作的核心思想","id":"原子操作的核心思想"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"问题背景","id":"问题背景"},{"level":2,"text":"核心原理","id":"核心原理"},{"level":3,"text":"思想一：不可分割性","id":"思想一-不可分割性"},{"level":3,"text":"思想二：无锁线程安全","id":"思想二-无锁线程安全"},{"level":3,"text":"思想三：硬件级高效性","id":"思想三-硬件级高效性"},{"level":2,"text":"分类与变体","id":"分类与变体"},{"level":3,"text":"CAS：比较并交换","id":"cas-比较并交换"},{"level":3,"text":"CAS 的 ABA 问题","id":"cas-的-aba-问题"},{"level":2,"text":"工作流程","id":"工作流程"},{"level":2,"text":"优劣对比","id":"优劣对比"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"原子操作的定义与核心概念","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/threads-concurrency/atomic-operations/atomic-definition-and-concepts"},"next":{"title":"原子操作的实现机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/threads-concurrency/atomic-operations/atomic-implementation"}}